'''Frostfire Atgeir''' is a version of [[Nord Atgeir]] upgraded with a [[Frostfire Essence]]. It loses a small amount of [[Pierce|pierce damage]] in exchange for a larger amount of [[fire]] and [[Frost|frost damage]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-stab combo with 2x damage on the last hit.
* The secondary attack is an AOE swing with a 3-meter radius that deals 1x damage and 6x stagger with no damage penalty against multiple targets.

An upgraded Nord Atgeir will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Frostfire Atgeir.

